@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+Generated using the built-in image generation tool. No reference images used.
+Final images saved as 1024x1024 PNG using sips.
+
+517-guilty-gear.png
+Create one fresh original 1024x1024 square image from text only. Use case: stylized-concept. Style is the absolute priority: Guilty Gear Strive-style cel-shaded 3D anime fighting game key frame, meticulously posed polygonal models that appear hand-drawn, hard graphic shadow shapes, angular ink outlines, extreme foreshortening, striking exaggerated anatomy, cinematic impact freeze. A woman in her early 30s with curly auburn shoulder-length hair, visible freckles, round tortoiseshell glasses and a mustard-yellow knit sweater is enjoying coffee while unleashing a spectacular coffee-explosion special move. Extreme low-angle Dutch-tilted three-quarter action shot: a huge foreshortened hand and coffee cup thrust toward the lens, joyful confident face farther back, sweeping torso and legs in a powerful airborne twisting pose. Sculpted curls, chunky angular sweater folds, bright cel-shaded highlights. Coffee erupts into a sweeping graphic amber-brown crescent with white steam lightning, speed slashes and jagged orange impact shapes. A clearly recognizable croissant on a saucer flies nearby. An open-air fighting arena of angular stone platforms and stark abstract crimson-black sky appears in fractured glimpses behind the attack. Absolutely no signage, no shop interiors, no chalkboards, no boards, no symbols or writing-like marks anywhere in the environment. Background design uses only stone geometry and pure abstract impact shapes. Flashy fighting-game rendering, stylized dramatic red-black-orange lighting; hard-shaded geometry, emphatically not photography or soft painterly concept art. Compose edge-to-edge as a single image. No UI, no letters, no words, no captions, no signatures, no logos, no watermarks. No reference images.
+
+518-hotline-miami.png
+Create one fresh original 1024x1024 square image from text only. Use case: stylized-concept. Authentic Hotline Miami game-art aesthetic: strict overhead top-down 2D pixel art, a floor-plan view of a small 1980s Miami apartment, extremely bold neon hot pink and electric cyan with purple-black shadow, chunky deliberately limited-resolution pixel clusters and stepped edges. Render as authentic low-resolution game pixel art enlarged to fill the square, not a 3D render, not isometric, not a photographic filter. Wide scene with the apartment architecture dominating: open living room and kitchenette, cyan tile floor, magenta couch, striped rug, tropical plant shadows, louvered window, compact coffee table. One small top-down game character seated at the table: a woman in her early 30s, curly auburn shoulder-length hair, freckles rendered as a few tiny pixels, round tortoiseshell glasses, mustard-yellow knit sweater. Her head is tilted up slightly so the stylized glasses and face read within the overhead sprite. She contentedly lifts a coffee mug toward her mouth; a croissant and a clearly recognizable animal mask rest on the table nearby. Psychedelic scrolling-looking neon color bands ripple through the room edges, pixel-wise VHS scanline glitches and displaced color strips add unsettling 80s video-game atmosphere. The action is peacefully enjoying coffee in this saturated uncanny apartment. No text, no letters, no HUD, no UI, no captions, no signatures, no logos, no watermark. Fresh original composition, no reference images.
+
+519-obra-dinn.png
+Create one fresh original 1024x1024 square image from text only. Use case: stylized-concept. Return of the Obra Dinn-style 1-bit dithered 3D game still. STRICT TWO-COLOR image: warm amber pixels on absolute black, no additional colors, no grayscale, no soft gradients, no antialiasing. Every surface and all light/shade are described through chunky ordered Bayer dithering, hard stippled silhouettes and stark angular low-poly 3D geometry. It should look like an eerie frozen memory inside a cramped old sailing ship's timber cabin. Intimate side-profile medium close view at seated eye height across the corner of a wooden table, strong depth leading to a tiny stern window, ropes, beams and a hanging lantern. The woman in her early 30s with curly auburn shoulder-length hair, freckles, round tortoiseshell glasses and a mustard-yellow knit sweater is quietly enjoying coffee, her cup raised near smiling lips, her other hand resting next to a croissant on the table. Translate ALL these character colors into the mandatory amber-and-black 1-bit values: curly outlined hair mass, dotted freckles, round patterned glasses and distinct patterned knit are the identity cues. Suspended angular coffee droplets and still steam suggest an uncanny arrested instant, not an action explosion. Window light carves her profile in hard amber pixels; heavy dither patterns sink the rest of the cabin into black. Authentic dithered polygonal game rendering rather than an ink drawing, engraving or a sepia photograph. Square full-frame single scene. No text, no letters, no interface, no captions, no signatures, no logos, no watermark. Generate from text only; no reference images.
+
+520-tunic.png
+Create one fresh original 1024x1024 square image from text only. Use case: stylized-concept. Tunic game-art aesthetic: a cute isometric 3D storybook adventure diorama, simple faceted low-poly forms, miniature toy-like proportions, soft tilt-shift depth of field, lush warm autumn landscape and luminous golden afternoon light. High isometric wide view, a broad mossy stone stairway curves down through russet and golden trees onto a little clearing with ancient rounded stone ruins and turquoise stream, intimate beautifully designed environment taking most of the frame. The little heroine is a woman in her early 30s translated into adorable Tunic-like proportions: large simplified head, tiny compact body and short limbs, stylized curly auburn shoulder-length hair, freckles, round tortoiseshell glasses and mustard-yellow knit sweater. She sits on a low mossy step peacefully sipping coffee with both hands around a tiny mug; a croissant rests on a folded napkin next to her. A tiny friendly fox companion nestles beside her feet. Her simplified glasses and auburn curl shapes are legible. Warm glowing rim light through the leaves, soft ambient occlusion under miniature forms, calm magical exploration mood, restrained pale jade, terracotta, ochre and golden cream palette. Natural square diorama composition viewed at a distance, clear focal pocket around woman and fox with softly blurred near leaves and distant terrain. Authentic stylized 3D adventure game art, no photographic human proportions, no anime action, no pixel art. No text, no letters, no runes, no UI, no captions, no signatures, no logos, no watermark. Single standalone scene generated fresh from text only, no reference images.

